<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2ti</book>
  <para style="h">Timɔte Firinden Sora</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kɛdi Firindena Timɔte Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Timɔte Firindena</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kɛdi Firindena Timɔte Ma</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔli Alaa Falan Kɛdi Firinden Timɔte Ma</para>
  <para style="ip">Kɛdi firinden naxan sɛbɛ Timɔte ma, na sɛbɛ Romi taan nin (1.17). Pɔli suxu nɛn a sa kasoon na kii xɔdɛxɛni (2.9) a yi lu a danna (4.10,16), a yi kawandi falani itoe sɛbɛ a fɔxɔrabira kɛndɛn ma xanuntenyani (1.2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Xɛrana a falan fɔlɔma Ala tantunna nan ma lan Timɔte a xanuntenyaan nun a dɛnkɛlɛyaan ma. Hali tɔrɔ gbeen nun matandin to xun tixi Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin nali muxune ma, a Timɔte yamarima a xa a sɛnbɛ so, a yi yɛngɛn so wɛkilɛni “alo Alaa Muxu Sugandixina sofa tinxinxina” (1.3 han 2.13). A a rakolonma a a xa a liga a yeren ma muxune fe yi naxanye fala fuune tima a findi matandin na e nun sɔnxɔ sɔnxɔn naxanye tɔnɔ mi na, naxanye dɛnkɛlɛyaan makuyama muxune ra. A yi a fala a xa, a a xa lu alo a tan yɛtɛna, a yi lu tinxinni alo Kitabuna a falaxi kii naxan yi, Timɔte naxan xaranxi xabu a banxulan ɲɔrɛ waxatini (2.14 han 4.5). A kɛdin naɲanna ra, xɛrana a yɛtɛna mantɔrɔne nan ma fe falama, a yi Ala tantun naxan yi a malima (4.6 han 22).</para>
  <para style="ip">Xɛra Pɔli gerenna so nɛn Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin nalideni han a siimayaan naɲanna (4.7). Kitabun xaran muxune fan lan nɛn, e yi na gerenna so, dɛnkɛlɛyaan nun diɲan nun xanuntenyaan nun sɛnbɛ soni, hali e mi gaxu Setana yɛɛ ra.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>N tan Pɔli, naxan findixi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina xɛraan na Ala sagoon xɔn ma alogo Ala en tuli saxi nii rakisin naxan na Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixini, n xa na rali, n tan nan ito sɛbɛxi, <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>n yi a rasiga n nafan dii xɛmɛn Timɔte ma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Fafe Ala nun en Marigi Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xa hinanna nun kininkininna nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla fi i ma.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Barika biran nun kawandina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>N walima Ala naxan xa bɔɲɛ rafixɛni alo n benbane a liga kii naxan yi, n barikan birama na xa, n nɛma a maxandɛ i xa kɔɛɛn nun yanyin na waxatin birin. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Amasɔtɔ, n nan n miri i ya wugan ma, a xɔnla n suxuma nɛn n xa i to alogo n xa lugo sɛwan na.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1.4</char> Timɔte <char style="fk">wuga</char> nɛn Pɔli keli Efɛsi taani waxatin naxan yi. A mato Timɔte Singen 1.3 kui.</note> <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>N xaxili mɔn i ya dɛnkɛlɛya kɛndɛn xɔn, naxan yi i mame Lowisi nun i nga Ewunise yi. N laxi a ra, fa fala a i fan yi. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Nanara, n na a rabirama i ma, Ala kiseen naxan fixi i ma, i xa na rawali i sɔbɛɛn na, i naxan sɔtɔxi n na n yiin sa i xunni waxatin naxan yi Ala maxandini. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Amasɔtɔ Ala mi Nii gaxuxin xan fixi en ma koni a Nii Sariɲanxina naxan sɛnbɛn nun xanuntenyaan nun sɔn faɲin fima en ma.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Nba, i nama yagi sereyaan bɛ en Marigin xa, hanma i yagi n tan ma fe ra hali n to kasoon na a fe ra. Koni en firinna xa tin tɔrɔyaan ma en bode xɔn lan Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲina fe ma Ala sɛnbɛn barakani. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>A tan nan en nakisixi, a yi en xili a en xa sariɲan. En kɛwanle fe mi a ra de, koni a yɛtɛna fe ragidixina, e nun a hinanna, a naxan fi en ma Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani benun dunuɲa xa da. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Koni iki a bata a yita en na en nakisimaan Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin minin xɔn ma kɛnɛnni, naxan faxan sɛnbɛn nɔxi, a yi nii rakisin nun faxatareyaan makɛnɛn Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin xɔn ma.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Ala bata n findi kawandi baan nun xɛraan nun karamɔxɔn na Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲina fe ra. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Nanara, n tɔrɔma feni itoe ra, koni n mi yagixi e fe ra amasɔtɔ n dɛnkɛlɛyaxi naxan ma, n na kolon. N laxi a ra, a nɔɛ n gbeen namarɛ nɛn han na lɔxɔni. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>I fala kɛndɛn naxanye mɛxi n yii, ne ramara misaala ra xanuntenyaan nun dɛnkɛlɛyani Alaa Muxu Sugandixin Yesu xɔn. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Se faɲin naxanye taxuxi i ra, ne mara Alaa Nii Sariɲanxin sɛnbɛn barakani naxan en yi.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>I a kolon fa fala naxanye birin Asi yamanani, ne bata n nabeɲin, hali Figelo nun Heremogene. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Ala xa Marigin kininkinin Onesiforo a denbayaan ma amasɔtɔ a n nii yifan nɛn n ma sanɲa ma wuyaxi. A mi yagi n ma fe ra hali n to kasoon na. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>A Romi taan li waxatin naxan yi, a yi a tunnafan n fenɲɛ han a yi n to. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Ala xa Marigin kininkinin a ma na Lɔxɔni. A feen naxanye liga n xa Efɛsi taani, i ne kolon yati!<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu a walikɛ faɲine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Nba, i tan n ma diina, i sɛnbɛ so na hinanni naxan Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixini. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>I feen naxanye mɛxi, n naxanye rali sereya wuyaxi yɛɛ xɔri, ne taxu lannaya muxune ra, naxanye fan nɔɛ muxu gbɛtɛye xaranɲɛ.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>En na en wɛkilɛ tɔrɔni en bode xɔn ma bayo en luxi nɛn alo Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixina sofa faɲine. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Muxun naxan sofa wanli, na mi basanɲɛ dunuɲa fe gbɛtɛ ra xa a waxi a kuntigin kɛnɛn feni. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Muxun naxan fan a gima xataɲɔxɔyani, xa na mi a yixɔdɔxɔ a gideni giin sariyani, a mi nɔɔn tiyɛ mumɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Xɛɛ biin naxan wali xɔdɛxɛn kɛma, na singe xa a gbee xɛɛ ma seen sɔtɔ. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>N naxan falama i xa, i miri na ma, amasɔtɔ Marigin famun fima nɛn i ma ne birin yi.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>I xaxili lu Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin xɔn ma naxan kelixi Dawuda bɔnsɔnni, naxan keli sayani, alo n na a ralima kii naxan yi Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲini, <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>n tɔrɔma naxan ma fe ra han n xidi alo fe ɲaxi rabana. Koni Alaa falan tan mi xidɛ mumɛ. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Nanara, n diɲaxi tɔrɔne birin bun ma yama sugandixina fe ra, alogo e fan xa kisin sɔtɔ naxan Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixini, e yi lu habadan binyeni. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Ɲɔndin nan falani ito ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">Xa en nun a tan bata faxa en bode xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">en nun a tan nii rakisin sɔtɔma nɛn.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Xa en na en tunnafan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">en nun a tan luma nɛn mangayani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Xa en na en mɛ a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">a fan a mɛma nɛn en na.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Xa en mi tinxinɲɛ ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">a tan tinxinma nɛn ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">amasɔtɔ a mi nɔɛ a mɛ a yɛtɛ ra.<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Na feene rabira muxune ma, i yi e yamari Ala yɛtagi, a e xa e yɛtɛ ratanga matandine ma lan falane bunne ma, matandin naxanye tɔnɔ yo mi na. A e ramɛ muxune nan halagima tun! <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>I kata, i yi i yɛtɛ yita Ala ra walikɛ kɛndɛn na, naxan wali xɔnne mi mayagi, naxan Alaa ɲɔndi falan nalima a kiini. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Xɛtɛ dina suxutare fala fuune fɔxɔ ra, amasɔtɔ naxanye e falama, ne luma e masigɛ Ala kolonna ra nɛn tun. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>E falan luxi nɛn alo furen naxan dɛ gboma ayi fatin ma. Humeneyo nun Fileto na muxune nan yɛ, <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>naxanye bata e masiga ɲɔndin na. E naxa, a muxune rakelima sayani waxatin naxan yi, na bata dangu. E muxuna ndee dɛnkɛlɛyaan kala. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Anu, Alaa banxin bɛtɛn saxi sandɔxɔ kɛndɛn naxan fari, na dɔxi ken, falani itoe kɛrɛndɛnxi a ma, a naxa, “Marigin gbeen muxun naxanye ra, a ne kolon. Xa naxan yo Marigin xinla falama, na xa a xun xanbi so tinxintareyani.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">2.19</char> Yatɛne 16.5</note><verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Waliseen sifa wuyaxi nan banxi gbeeni, gbeti daxin nun xɛma daxin na koni a wudi daxin nun a bɛndɛ ganxin fan na. Ndee rawalima binya feene yi, ndee rawalima binyatare feene yi. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Xa muxu yo a yɛtɛ rasariɲan na binyatareya feene ma, a luma nɛn alo walise binyaxina. A to sariɲan, a kanna nɔɛ a rawalɛ wali faɲin birin yi. <verse eid="2TI 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>I gi foningeyaan waxatin kunfa feene ma. Ɛ nun naxanye Marigin batuma bɔɲɛ fixɛn na, ɛ bira tinxinyaan nun dɛnkɛlɛyaan nun xanuntenyaan nun bɔɲɛ xunbenla nan fɔxɔ ra ɛ bode xɔn. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>I mɛ xaxilitareyaan nun daxuyaan fe matandine ra, i yi a kolon fa fala a ne fama yɛngɛn nan na. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Anu, Marigina walikɛɛn mi lan a yɛngɛn so. Koni a lan nɛn a fan birin na, a findi karamɔxɔ faɲin nun muxu diɲaxin na. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>A lan nɛn a xa fe matandine matinxin limaniyani alogo Ala xa a liga e yi e kɛwanle maxɛtɛ, e yi ɲɔndin kolon. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>E yi xaxili sɔtɔ, e e yɛtɛ ba Yinna Manga Setanaa luti ratixine ra, e suxi naxanye ra alogo e xa lu a sagoni.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Dunuɲa raɲanna fe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>A kolon fa fala a waxati dɔnxɛne xɔdɔxɔma ayi nɛn. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Amasɔtɔ muxune findima nɛn wasodene nun gbeti xɔnxɔnne nun yɛtɛ matɔxɔne nun yandadene nun konbi tiine ra. E murutɛ e sɔtɔ muxune ma, e findi wali faɲi kolontarene nun dina kolontarene ra, <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>e nun hinantarene nun kininkinintarene nun muxu xili kalane nun yɛtɛ suxutarene nun muxu yɛɛ xɔdɛxɛne nun fe faɲi rabane yaxune <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>e nun yanfantenne nun kunfadene nun yɛtɛ yigboon naxanye waxɔn feene rafan e ma dangu Ala ra. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>E e yɛtɛ findi Ala kolonne ra, koni e e mɛma nɛn a sɛnbɛn na. I makuya na muxune ra. <verse eid="2TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Ndee ɛ yɛ, ne e yɛtɛ rasoma nɛn banxine kui muxu rakunfa feen na, ɲaxanla naxanye sɛnbɛ mi gbo dinani, e yi ne masɔtɔ yulubin goron binyen naxanye xun ma naxanye mabandunxi kunfan sifan birin xɔn. <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>Na ɲaxanle katama nɛn e xa xaran, koni e mi ɲɔndin kolonɲɛ mumɛ! <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Na xɛmɛne luxi nɛn alo Yannɛsi nun Yanbɛrɛsi naxanye Musa matandi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">3.8</char> Yahudiyane namunne xaranna kui, woyimɛɛn naxanye Musa matandi Misiran yamanani, ne yi xili na kiini. A mato Xɔrɔyaan 7.11 nun 7.22 kui.</note> Xɛmɛni itoe fan ɲɔndin matandima na kii nin. E xaxinli fuxi, e dɛnkɛlɛyaan bata findi bɔnɔn na. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Koni ne mi sigɛ yɛɛn na mumɛ amasɔtɔ muxun birin e xaxilitareyaan kolonma nɛn, alo Yannɛsi nun Yanbɛrɛsi liga kii naxan yi.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kawandi dɔnxɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Koni i tan bata n ma xaranna kolon, e nun n kɛwanle nun n ɲɛnigen nun n ma dɛnkɛlɛyaan nun n ma diɲan nun n ma xanuntenyaan nun n ma tunnafanna <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>e nun n ma bɛsɛnxɔnyaan nun n ma tɔrɔyana. Tɔrɔn sifan mundun na, n mi naxan toxi Antiyɔki nun Ikoniyon nun Lisitire taane yi? Bɛsɛnxɔnyaan sifan mundun na n mi naxan to? Koni Marigin yi n xunba ne birin yi. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Naxanye birin waxi a xɔn ma, e xa sigan ti Ala kolonni Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin barakani, ne bɛsɛnxɔnyama nɛn. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Koni muxu ɲaxine nun naxanye e yɛtɛ findima dina muxune ra, ne yanfanma ɲaxuyaan nin tun, e bonne mayenden, e fan yi mayenden. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Koni i tan, i xaranxi feen naxan ma, i dɛnkɛlɛyaxi naxan ma yati, lu na yi amasɔtɔ i i karamɔxɔne kolon. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Xabu i dii ɲɔrɛ waxatini, i Kitabu Sariɲanxin yire sɛbɛxine kolon naxan nɔɛ xaxinla fiyɛ i ma lan kisi feen ma dɛnkɛlɛyaan xɔn Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin ma. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Amasɔtɔ Kitabun sɛbɛnla birin fataxi Ala nan na. A fan xaran ti seen nun tantanna yabi seen nun fe matinxin seen nun muxu xuru seen na tinxinna ma <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>alogo Alaa muxun xa kamali, waliseen yi lu a yii wali faɲin birin kɛ xinla ma.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>N na i yamarima Ala yɛtagi e nun Yesu Alaa Muxu Sugandixin naxan faxa muxune nun muxu niiramane birin makitima, naxan makɛnɛnma a mangayani. <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Alaa falana fe kawandin ba, xa a fala waxatin fan, xa a mi fan, i wɛkilɛ. I muxune sɔnna fala, i e maxadi, i e ralimaniya, i yi e xaran diɲan birin yi. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Amasɔtɔ waxatin fama nɛn, muxune mi tinma xaran kɛndɛn ma. E birama e yɛtɛ waxɔn feene nan fɔxɔ ra, e lu karamɔxɔne malanɲɛ e yɛtɛ xa, naxanye e xaranma e tunla rafan feene ma. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>E yi e tunla ba ɲɔndi falane ra, e yi e tuli mati taline ra. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Koni i tan, i xa i yɛtɛ suxu feen birin yi, i tunnafan tɔrɔne bun ma, i Yesu a fe Xibaru Faɲin nali, i yi i ya wanla birin nakamali.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Amasɔtɔ, n tan bata lu alo minse saraxa bɔxɔnxina, n siga waxatin bata maso. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>N bata yɛngɛ faɲin so, n nan n ma giin danna li, n lu dɛnkɛlɛyani. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>To xanbi ra, n tinxinyaan nɔ sɔtɔn kɔntɔnna sɔtɔma nɛn Marigin naxan namaraxi n xa, a naxan fima n ma na lɔxɔni, a tan naxan findixi kiti sa tinxinxin na. N tan kedenna mi a ra koni a fa feen xɔnla naxanye birin ma.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Kata, i fa n fɛma mafurɛn! <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Dunuɲani ito to rafan Demasi ma, a bata n nabeɲin a siga Tesaloniki taani. Kiresen yi siga Galati yamanani. Tito yi siga Dalamatiya yamanani. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Luka nan keden pe fa n fɛma. Ɛ nun Maraka birin xa fa amasɔtɔ a nɔɛ n maliyɛ nɛn walideni. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>N bata Tikiko rasiga Efɛsi taani. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>I nɛma fɛ waxatin naxan yi, n bata n ma gubaan nun n ma kɛdine lu Karapo konni Tirowasi taani, i fa e xɛlɛ n xa a gbengbenna naxanye sɛbɛxi kidine ma.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>Siyakin Alesandire bata fe xɔlɛn liga n na han! Marigina a saranɲɛ a wanla ra. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>I fan xa a fe liga i yeren ma, amasɔtɔ a nxɔ falane matandi nɛn a ɲaxin na!<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>N nan n yɛtɛ xun mafala singen naxan ti kitisadeni, muxu yo mi n mali, birin yi n nabeɲin. Koni Ala nama e suxu na ra. <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Marigin nan n mali, a yi n sɛnbɛ so alogo n xa kawandi kamalixin ba, siyane birin yi a mɛ, n yi xunba yatane dɛ. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Marigina n xunbama nɛn fe ɲaxin wanle birin ma, a yi n nakisi alogo n xa so a mangayani ariyanna yi. Binyen xa fi a tan ma habadan han habadan, amina.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xɔntɔn dɔnxɛne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>N xa Pirisila nun Akila xɔntɔn e nun Onesiforo a denbayana. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>Erasite bata lu Kɔrɛnti taani, n bata Tirofime furaxin fan lu Mileti taani. <verse eid="2TI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Kata, i xa fa benun xunbeli waxatin xa a li.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ewubulo i xɔntɔn, e nun Pudɛn nun Linosi nun Kelodiya e nun en ngaxakedenne birin.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Marigin xa lu i niini. Ala xa hinan ɛ ra.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
